---

---

<section class="px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24" id="about">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-white/10 pt-12 sm:pt-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] md:gap-16">
      <h2 class="text-[42px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] text-white" data-motion="fade-left">Voidix 是什么？</h2>
      <div data-motion="fade-right">
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-[17px] leading-8 text-gray-400">
          Voidix 是 NekoSora 和 CYsonHab 创立的一个 Minecraft
          公益服务器。继承VBPIXEL和EternalStar的精神。我们坚持无商业化运营，致力于为所有玩家提供公平与和谐的游戏环境。
        </p>
        <a
          href="/status"
          class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#a6b8ff] transition-colors hover:text-white"
        >
          查看完整状态
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid border-y border-white/10 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="py-6 sm:py-7">
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">在线玩家</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-white" data-total-players>0人</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-white/10 py-6 sm:border-l sm:border-t-0 sm:px-8 sm:py-7">
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">运行时间</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-white" data-current-uptime>0分</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-white/10 py-6 sm:border-l sm:border-t-0 sm:pl-8 sm:py-7">
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">总运行时长</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-white" data-total-uptime>0分</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-5 md:grid-cols-2" data-motion="fade-up">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 py-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500" id="minigame-status-dot-desktop" data-minigame-about-dot
          ></span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-200">小游戏服务器</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-red-400" id="minigame-status-badge-desktop" data-minigame-summary
          >获取中...</span
        >
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 py-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-500" id="survival-status-dot-desktop"></span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-200">生存服务器</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-yellow-400" id="survival-status-badge-desktop" data-survival-summary
          >获取中...</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
